    "security_definer_rpcs_run_with_owner_rights": "admin_update_team_member, apply_follow_up_action, delete_manual_message and pipeline_auto_advance are SECURITY DEFINER exactly as in the source, so they bypass RLS once invoked. They are gated by EXECUTE grants and by the server-owned API, which authorizes the caller before invoking them. S15 owns that handler authorization.",
