    "pgcrypto_functions_are_public_executable": "pgcrypto is installed in public by S05 and its functions keep the extension's default PUBLIC EXECUTE, so generated SQL can call them. They read no application data and every S07 catalog assertion excludes extension members from the portable function inventory."
